      "question": "The cash-basis budget schedule (p7) prints Restricted Cash Deposits 106,820 among expenditures, but the cash flow statement (p5) shows it as 'Purchases of restricted deposits' under investing activities (a move into restricted cash, not spending). Should this detail line stay an expenditure as printed, or be excluded from spending?",
