  "notes": "Entirely business-type entity (single proprietary fund); governmental fields null. Qualified opinion (GASB 87 leases not applied) on p1. Receipts = operating revenues plus nonoperating grants, interest and rent; disbursements = operating expenses plus interest expense and bond fees (reported_totals computed since statement prints separate operating/nonoperating totals). Roll-forward 4,357,454 + 4,005,234 - 1,410,024 = 6,952,664. Cash flow statement: 'Net cash used in financing activities' (985,466) labelled capital and related financing; no noncapital financing section. Detail: budget schedule p7 is cash basis; its revenue lines are recorded, and of its expenditure lines only Debt Service 145,953, Restricted Cash Deposits 106,820 and Equipment Replacement and Construction 2,514,200 (no other schedule itemizes them). Its Landfill Operations line 802,604 is left out because the more detailed operating expense schedule on p8 covers it (not double counted), so no detail_totals entry is kept for p7's Total Expenditures 3,569,577. Landfill treated as function utilities (refuse). Printed label 'Grants Reveivable' sic. Trimmed p6 (added by v7 re-trim) is the cash flow statement's operating income reconciliation; nothing new. Read pages 1-8 of 8"
}